cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Giye, please cite it as below."
title: "Giye: A provenance-preserving pipeline for building a person register of the Korean media art field"
authors:
  - family-names: Bae
    given-names: Joonhyung
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5933-4302"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Giye builds an evidence-gated, provenance-first person register of a creative
  field from public programme rosters and CVs. It keeps the original bytes of
  every cited page, resolves the same person across scripts and spellings by
  written evidence rules, and publishes permanent identifiers. The reference
  archive covers the Korean media art field at https://giye.org.
keywords:
  - archive
  - provenance
  - person register
  - record linkage
  - media art
  - web archiving
license: AGPL-3.0-only
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/joonhyungbae/giye"
url: "https://giye.org"
